# interview_helper_mux (v2)

Local pipeline: long-form interview audio → **`master/master.wav`**. Specs in **`docs/`**; prompts in **`docs/prompts/`** are authoritative for LLM copy.

**Read order:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · [NORTH_STAR.md](../../NORTH_STAR.md) · [docs/workflows/operator-journey.md](../../docs/workflows/operator-journey.md)

---

## Hard constraints

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **Context7** | Before changing Python/shell calling third-party libs: MCP **`user-context7`** → `resolve-library-id` → `query-docs`. Pins from **`requirements.lock`**. |
| **Python** | 3.12 in **`.venv`** — **`scripts/bootstrap_venv.sh`**. |
| **Local MLX** | STT/diarization + S2S in **`ASSETS/local_speech/venv`**; volley framer in **`ASSETS/local_llm/venv`** (fail-open). Bootstrap **`scripts/bootstrap_venv.sh`**. |
| **Local audio** | DeepFilterNet + MMAudio in isolated ASSETS venvs — **`docs/cross-cutting/local-audio-stack.md`**. No cloud audio APIs. |
| **LLM** | OpenAI artifacts via **`llm_simple.py`**; local MLX framer prep only (LX-01). Max 2 attempts per stage. |
| **Secrets** | **`config/secrets/secrets.env`** only. |
| **Media** | Default **`./ASSETS/`** (gitignored). Runs under **`ASSETS/executions/`**. |
| **Schemas** | Validate with **`prompt_validation`** + **`docs/cross-cutting/json-schemas/`**. |

---

## Operator gates (v2)

| Gate | When | Action |
|------|------|--------|
| **G0** | After `transcript_review_build` | Fix STT in GUI before analysis |
| **G-Framing** | After topology (before gap LLM) | Required choice; recommended **Yes** + voice-cloned least-spoken host |
| **G1** | After gap stages (optional) | Record/synthesize VO or skip |
| **Preclean** | Checkpoint offer | Never auto-run |

Full copy: **`docs/workflows/operator-gates.md`**.

---

## Pipeline

- **32 stages:** 19 analysis + 13 delivery — orders in **`src/interview_mux/v2/config.py`**
- **Idempotency:** `.stage_done/<stage_id>`; **`--from-stage`** per **`docs/workflows/idempotent-runs.md`**
- **Artifacts:** writes via `ctx.path()` / `ctx.write_json()`; reads via `ctx.read_path()` / `ctx.read_json()` — see **`write_staging.py`**

---

## GUI

- Phase workbench: **`PhaseWorkbench.tsx`** · journey from **`v2/phases.py`**
- Launch: **`./scripts/run.sh`** or **`python -m interview_mux serve`**
- Bundle: **`./scripts/build_gui.sh`** when `frontend/src` changes

